      "readme": "# Natural Movie fMRI Dataset (Raw, DeepPrep Derivatives, and Questionnaires)\n\nThis dataset contains naturalistic movie-watching fMRI data collected during three movie viewing conditions: movie1, movie2, and movie3.\n\n## Dataset Contents\n\n1. Raw Data (Dataset Root)\n   - Structural (T1w) and functional fMRI raw BOLD images formatted according to BIDS standards.\n   - Tasks included: movie1, movie2, and movie3.\n\n2. Preprocessed Derivatives (derivatives/deepprep/)\n   - Preprocessed functional MRI data generated using the DeepPrep preprocessing pipeline.\n   - Functional images were spatially normalized to the MNI152NLin2009cAsym standard space.\n   - Includes preprocessed BOLD time series and accompanying confound time series (timeseries.tsv/json).\n\n3. Behavioral Data (sourcedata/)\n   - Behavioral questionnaires are stored in the `sourcedata/questionnaire battery/` directory.\n\n## Structure\nThe dataset strictly follows the Brain Imaging Data Structure (BIDS) v1.8.0 specification.",
